# Cloudflare Pages. A document's address (/library/<source>/<slug>) is not a
# prerendered file: serve the SPA shell, which reads the path and opens the
# document. Without this rule Pages still serves 404.html (the same shell), but
# with status 404. The shell is identical for every path, so the response says
# nothing about whether a document exists; only the private API knows.
/library/*  /404.html  200
